@startuml sequence-figure-decision
!include elvira.iuml
' What: both figures tasks crop and gate every region, hide page furniture repeated across pages without a model, and ask decider-vision for a category and a band for the rest; a judge that does not answer leaves the region unbanded, never fails the job.
' Kind: UML sequence diagram, one figures job. Scope: image-service's side; the analyzer, the catalog and the digitalizer appear only as senders and receivers.
' Source: issues evilflowers-image-service#6 and #7, evilflowers-worker#5/#6/#7 (kit e530f68), EvilFlowersCatalog#189, knowledge#64 (2026-11-16)
title Figure keep/hide in both figures tasks (image-service#6, #7, 2026-11-16)
participant "analyzer\n(catalog run)" as analyzer
participant "digitalizer\norchestrator" as orch <<proposed>>
participant "FigureReader\n(figures.py)" as reader <<focus>>
database "STORAGE_PATH" as storage
participant "decider-vision\nPOST /v1/systemone" as decider <<proposed>>
participant "catalog\n/extraction/v1" as catalog

alt catalog task evilflowers_image.figures
  analyzer -> reader : RegionsJob {run_id, source PDF, output_dir, regions}
else standalone task evilflowers_image.standalone.figures
  orch -> reader : StandaloneFiguresJob {run_id, job, token, leaves, regions, output_dir, outcome}\n+ link / link_error
end
loop pass 1: every region
  reader -> storage : render at CROP_DPI, gate (size, aspect, coverage), write WebP crop
  reader -> reader : dHash of the crop
end
reader -> reader : same dHash on >= REPEAT_MIN_PAGES pages:\nband hide, decision repeated (no model)
loop pass 2: every region not repeated (job budget, circuit breaker)
  reader -[$accent_msg()]> decider : <b>figure_kind</b> choice + crop (PNG, <= 448 px)
  decider --> reader : choice, p, model
  reader -> reader : band from JUDGE_THRESHOLDS (none until knowledge#65);\ncategory = choice
end
alt catalog task
  reader -> catalog : POST /regions (band, p, decision, decider_model)
  reader -> catalog : POST /jobs/<job> done
else standalone task
  reader -> storage : figures.json, then the outcome file (last, atomic)
  reader --> orch : link: {job, figures}
end
caption decider-vision unreachable, refused, over budget or DECIDER_ENABLED off: the region is posted without a band, as before\n(image_judge_total{outcome}). Every crop is written whatever its band; review becomes a disputed region in the page studio.
footer ELVIRA · FIIT STU · evilflowers-image-service · docs/diagrams/sequence-figure-decision.puml
@enduml
